<<
/A 1091 0 R
/Alt (Dot plot showing the coefficient of variation across the three experimental conditions \(Control, Simple, and Complex\). Gray dots represent individual observations, while large blue dots indicate the estimated marginal means from the GLMM, with vertical blue bars representing 95% confidence intervals. A bracket with an asterisk indicates a statistically significant difference between the Control and Complex conditions \(p < 0.05\).)
